{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"744","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Hongcow Buys a Deck of Cards"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day, Hongcow goes to the store and sees a brand new deck of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" special cards. Each individual card is either red or blue. He decides he wants to buy them immediately. To do this, he needs to play a game with the owner of the store."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This game takes some number of turns to complete. On a turn, Hongcow may do one of two things: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Collect tokens. Hongcow collects "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" red token "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" blue token by choosing this option (thus, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" tokens in total per one operation). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy a card. Hongcow chooses some card and spends tokens to purchase it as specified below. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th card requires "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" red resources and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" blue resources. Suppose Hongcow currently has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":" red cards and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":" blue cards. Then, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th card will require Hongcow to spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"max(ri - A, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":" red tokens, and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"max(bi - B, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":" blue tokens. Note, only tokens disappear, but the cards stay with Hongcow forever. Each card can be bought only once."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Given a description of the cards and their costs determine the minimum number of turns Hongcow needs to purchase all cards."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input will contain a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 16"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines of input will contain three tokens "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":". "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', denoting the color of the card as red or blue. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be an integer denoting the amount of red resources required to obtain the card, and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be an integer denoting the amount of blue resources required to obtain the card ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ ri, bi ≤ 107"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer, denoting the minimum number of turns needed to acquire all the cards."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\nR 0 1\nB 1 0\nR 1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\nR 3 0\nR 2 0\nR 1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first sample, Hongcow's four moves are as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Collect tokens "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" Note, at the fourth step, Hongcow is able to buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" because Hongcow already has one red and one blue card, so we don't need to collect tokens."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second sample, one optimal strategy is as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Collect tokens "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Collect tokens "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Collect tokens "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Buy card "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" At the fifth step, even though Hongcow has a red token, Hongcow doesn't actually need to spend it, since Hongcow has a red card already."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"744C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/744/problem/C"}